<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 14.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 14.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Jan 14	Jan 13	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  248.000     248.080     247.020    0.40 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.340     304.700     306.830   -1.14 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.090     156.900     158.970   -1.81 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.240	46.496	47.182   -2.00 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  414.480     416.600     419.180   -1.12 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.035     139.715     141.685   -1.87 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.045	16.134	16.185   -0.86 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  212.570     212.860     212.430    0.07 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.867	 1.879	 1.888   -1.11 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.564	 1.575	 1.581   -1.08 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  180.840     180.190     183.135   -1.25 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the January</p>
<p>02, 1997 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
